    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/030acb719ecf70bbd22e2ad28ede7421.avif?t=1745490513\" /></div><br><strong>inbento</strong> is a chill pattern-matching puzzle game where you prepare Japanese lunch boxes (bento) while enjoying a cute story about parenthood and growing up. Recreate over 120 puzzling recipes, master tricky mechanics and learn about the life of the kitten family as you pour your love into the food you create.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/c9300af118019523a58c44de0d0422cc.poster.avif?t=1745490513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/c9300af118019523a58c44de0d0422cc.webm?t=1745490513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/c9300af118019523a58c44de0d0422cc.mp4?t=1745490513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOLVE THE RECIPES</h2>In each puzzle you start with a limited number of ingredients and a picture of the final result - rotate, move and insert the food in the right order to rediscover the original recipe and make a delicious dish!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A HEARTWARMING STORY</h2>Finishing each chapter will reward you with interactive illustrations offering glimpses into the life of a cat family and the ups &amp; downs of parenthood.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/c26d316d41a5fb35904e0ca9d738de8e.avif?t=1745490513\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">120+ MEALS TO PREPARE</h2>Over the course of the game you will encounter new mechanics that allow you to swap, remove and copy ingredients in order to make the puzzles more exciting!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ZERO UNDERSTANDING OF COOKING REQUIRED</h2>You don\u2019t need to be a pro chef to play inbento - the game\u2019s relaxed pace and textless tutorial will offer all the guidance you need to have a great time!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/030acb719ecf70bbd22e2ad28ede7421.avif?t=1745490513\" /></div><br><strong>inbento</strong> is a chill pattern-matching puzzle game where you prepare Japanese lunch boxes (bento) while enjoying a cute story about parenthood and growing up. Recreate over 120 puzzling recipes, master tricky mechanics and learn about the life of the kitten family as you pour your love into the food you create.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/c9300af118019523a58c44de0d0422cc.poster.avif?t=1745490513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/c9300af118019523a58c44de0d0422cc.webm?t=1745490513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/c9300af118019523a58c44de0d0422cc.mp4?t=1745490513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOLVE THE RECIPES</h2>In each puzzle you start with a limited number of ingredients and a picture of the final result - rotate, move and insert the food in the right order to rediscover the original recipe and make a delicious dish!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A HEARTWARMING STORY</h2>Finishing each chapter will reward you with interactive illustrations offering glimpses into the life of a cat family and the ups &amp; downs of parenthood.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567440/extras/c26d316d41a5fb35904e0ca9d738de8e.avif?t=1745490513\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">120+ MEALS TO PREPARE</h2>Over the course of the game you will encounter new mechanics that allow you to swap, remove and copy ingredients in order to make the puzzles more exciting!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ZERO UNDERSTANDING OF COOKING REQUIRED</h2>You don\u2019t need to be a pro chef to play inbento - the game\u2019s relaxed pace and textless tutorial will offer all the guidance you need to have a great time!",
